* If the e-bike stops working outside of the parking spot, would we recommend the rider to park the scooter safely and report to us or would there be any other solution? - {color:#36b37e}We will forbid to park outside the parking spot{color}
* Will there be a new icon? - {color:#36b37e}Yes, the logo should be different.{color}
* What are the price components, fines (if any)? - {color:#36b37e}Pricing (a subject to change): 0€ unlock & 0.1€/min.{color}
* What is the age limit? Is it 18 years as for scooters? - {color:#36b37e}18 years, as decided by the OPS team.{color}
* Will there be a max trip duration? - {color:#36b37e}Yes.{color}

